      <title>GPT-5：AI界新王登基？等等，数学题它咋还算不对呢？！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/gpt-5ai-20250809021005097-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 09 Aug 2025 02:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
